{"comment_text": {"ja50:0.1": "", "ja50:0.2": "", "ja50:0.3": "", "ja50:0.4": "", "ja50:1.1": "The Bodhisatta, though an unbeliever, regularly offers flowers to a deity while still the crown prince. On ascending the throne, he announces that he must pay back the deity by offering a thousand evildoers in sacrifice. The bluff had the intended effect, for from that day not a single evildoer was to be found. ", "ja50:1.2": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Upayācita</i> here has the same meaning as in Sanskrit, a promise or pledge made to propitiate a deity. It occurs at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/ja544/en/sujato#122.1'>Ja 544:122.1</a> in the same sense. ", "ja50:1.3": "", "ja50:1.4": "", "ja50:2.1": "", "ja50:2.2": "", "ja50:3.1": "", "ja50:4.1": "", "ja50:4.2": "", "ja50:4.3": "", "ja50:4.4": "", "ja50:5.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja50:0.1": "<article id='ja50'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja50:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja50:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja50:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja50:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja50:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p>", "ja50:2.2": "<p class='endvagga'>{}</p>", "ja50:3.1": "<p class='uddana-intro'>{}</p>", "ja50:4.1": "<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja50:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja50:5.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja50:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja50:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja50:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja50:0.4": "10. Dummedhajātaka ", "ja50:1.1": "“Dummedhānaṁ sahassena, ", "ja50:1.2": "yañño me upayācito; ", "ja50:1.3": "Idāni khohaṁ yajissāmi, ", "ja50:1.4": "bahu adhammiko jano”ti. ", "ja50:2.1": "Dummedhajātakaṁ dasamaṁ. ", "ja50:2.2": "Atthakāmavaggo pañcamo. ", "ja50:3.1": "Tassuddānaṁ ", "ja50:4.1": "Atha mittaka mātu kapotavaro, ", "ja50:4.2": "Tathā veḷuka eḷamūgo rohiṇī; ", "ja50:4.3": "Kapi vāruṇi cetacarā ca puna, ", "ja50:4.4": "Tathā tāraka yaññavarena dasāti. ", "ja50:5.1": "Paṭhamo paṇṇāsako. "}, "translation_text": {"ja50:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 50 ", "ja50:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja50:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja50:0.4": "The Simpleton: a past life story ", "ja50:1.1": "A sacrifice of simpletons by the thousand ", "ja50:1.2": "was pledged by me. ", "ja50:1.3": "Now I shall sacrifice ", "ja50:1.4": "many an unrighteous man. ", "ja50:2.1": "", "ja50:2.2": "", "ja50:3.1": "", "ja50:4.1": "", "ja50:4.2": "", "ja50:4.3": "", "ja50:4.4": "", "ja50:5.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja50:0.1": "", "ja50:0.2": "", "ja50:0.3": "", "ja50:0.4": "", "ja50:1.1": "", "ja50:1.2": "", "ja50:1.3": "", "ja50:1.4": "bahu → bahū (bj, pts-vp-pli1); bahuṁ (mr) ", "ja50:2.1": "", "ja50:2.2": "", "ja50:3.1": "", "ja50:4.1": "", "ja50:4.2": "", "ja50:4.3": "", "ja50:4.4": "", "ja50:5.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja50:0.1": "", "ja50:0.2": "", "ja50:0.3": "", "ja50:0.4": "", "ja50:1.1": "ms22J_108, msdiv50, pts-vp-pli1.260", "ja50:1.2": "", "ja50:1.3": "", "ja50:1.4": "", "ja50:2.1": "ms22J_109", "ja50:2.2": "", "ja50:3.1": "ms22J_110", "ja50:4.1": "ms22J_111, sya27.17", "ja50:4.2": "", "ja50:4.3": "", "ja50:4.4": "", "ja50:5.1": "ms22J_112"}, "keys_order": ["ja50:0.1", "ja50:0.2", "ja50:0.3", "ja50:0.4", "ja50:1.1", "ja50:1.2", "ja50:1.3", "ja50:1.4", "ja50:2.1", "ja50:2.2", "ja50:3.1", "ja50:4.1", "ja50:4.2", "ja50:4.3", "ja50:4.4", "ja50:5.1"]}